 "52": {
  "name": "Cross Ranch State Park",
  "description": "Located along one of the last free-flowing, undeveloped stretches of the Missouri River,\u00a0Cross Ranch State Park is rich in both cultural and natural history. Two riverside campgrounds are close to nature trails, canoeing, kayaking and boating access. Cabins and yurts are available for overnight lodging year-round and visitors enjoy the extensive winter trail system that's groomed for cross-country skiing.",
