 "54": {
  "name": "Fort Ransom State Park",
  "description": "Fort Ransom State Park is located in the scenic and historic Sheyenne River Valley. The forested park is home to a pioneer-era farmstead that hosts a twice-yearly Sodbuster Days celebration. Book a unique stay in a yurt, historic homestead or a covered wagon. Popular activities include kayaking, snowmobiling, cross-country skiing, modern and primitive camping, biking, horseback riding or hiking the North Country National Scenic Trail.",
