 "61": {
  "name": "Little Missouri State Park",
  "description": "High on the bluffs overlooking the Little Missouri River,\u00a0Little Missouri State Park offers a wilderness experience in the picturesque North Dakota Badlands. The park has horse corrals along with modern and primitive camping. Visitors can enjoy breathtaking views from the rugged trails in this seasonal park, open May-October.",
